  "Starting Skate": "",
  "Skate is starting": "",
  "Offline mode: playing without Steam as Unknown Player; multiplayer is hidden.": "",
  "The launcher hides while you play and returns when Skate closes.": "",
  "The launcher closes now; Skate keeps starting on its own.": "",
  "Anti-virus software usually blocks this. Add your skate. folder as an exclusion, close overlays (Discord, MSI Afterburner, RTSS), then press RETRY.": "",
  "ReSkate's files are not together": "",
  "Keep ReSkateLauncher.exe and ReSkate.dll together in a folder of their own (not Steam's skate. folder) and run the launcher from there. It installs the game into that folder.": "",
  "ReSkate.dll is missing": "",
  "Extract ReSkateLauncher.exe and ReSkate.dll from the same release zip into this folder, then press RETRY.": "",
  "ReSkate.dll is damaged": "",
  "Download the release zip again and extract both files over this folder. Your anti-virus may also have quarantined part of it.": "",
  "Skate.exe is not in this folder": "",
  "Run the launcher from your skate. folder, or press INSTALL to download the game here.": "",
  "The original steam_api64.dll is missing": "",
  "Verify the game files in Steam, or press DOWNLOAD to fetch the supported build again.": "",
  "This launcher is out of date": "",
  "Download the newest ReSkate release from GitHub and extract it over this folder.": "",
  "The ReSkate update server could not be reached": "",
  "Check your internet connection and press RETRY. If the game files are already correct you can turn on Offline mode in Settings and play without the check.": "",
  "This copy of skate. is not the supported build": "",
  "Press DOWNLOAD to get the supported build with your Steam account. Only the files that differ are downloaded.": "",
  "The Steam download did not finish": "",
  "Check that the account you signed in with owns skate. and that you have about 14 GB free, then press DOWNLOAD again. Signing in again often clears it.": "",
  "Another ReSkate launcher is busy": "",
  "It is installing the game data this build needs. Wait for it to finish, then press RETRY.": "",
  "The one-time game data download failed": "",
  "ReSkate downloads the game's catalogues once per build. Check your internet connection and press RETRY.": "",
  "The menu and console share a key": "",
  "Open Settings > KEYS and pick a different key for one of them.": "",
  "Skate.exe is set to always run as administrator": "",
  "ReSkate has to start Skate itself, and Windows does not let it start a program marked to need administrator. Right-click Skate.exe, pick Properties, then Compatibility, and untick \"Run this program as an administrator\". Starting ReSkateLauncher.exe as administrator works too.": "",
  "Security software or an overlay is modifying Skate while it starts, and ReSkate will not load itself through that. Allow ReSkateLauncher.exe and Skate.exe in it, or close it, then press RETRY.": "",
  "Something is hooking Skate as it starts": "",
  "Skate closed while it was starting": "",
  "Skate took too long to start": "",
  "A slow disk or an anti-virus scan usually causes this. Press RETRY; if it keeps happening, add your skate. folder as an exclusion.": "",
  "ReSkate could not attach to Skate": "",
  "ReSkate cannot write to its own folder": "",
  "Move the whole ReSkate folder somewhere else, such as C:\\Games\\ReSkate, and start it from there. Program Files and OneDrive do not let it write.": "",
  "Press RETRY. If it keeps happening, copy the details below and share them with logs\\ReSkate.log on the ReSkate Discord.": "",
